      "en": "### Welcome and Goodbye\n\n```text\nHello!\nHello Hello!\nBye Bye Goodbye\n```\n\n### Group Warmth and Routine\n\n```text\nThe More We Get Together\nClean Up Song\nMake A Circle\n```\n\nSongs are used for welcome, emotional settling, transition, group warmth, and simple participation. Children may listen, wave, clap, move, or stay close.",
